WEBVTT

01:01:59.750 --> 01:02:03.476
And then the final type of contract
is more of a cause,

01:02:03.500 --> 01:02:06.268
where you say, "Look, I will
give you extraordinary levels

01:02:06.292 --> 01:02:08.309
of effort and dedication and grit.

01:02:08.333 --> 01:02:11.393
And in return, what I want to do
is I want to make a difference,

01:02:11.417 --> 01:02:13.000
hopefully not change the world."

01:02:13.792 --> 01:02:17.393
I think that contracts get breached
when somebody has a set of expectations

01:02:17.417 --> 01:02:20.934
that are not met, often
by the employer, or by their boss.

01:02:20.958 --> 01:02:23.893
I think that a betrayal
is when people go further

01:02:23.917 --> 01:02:26.643
and they avoid or violate
the contract and say,

01:02:26.667 --> 01:02:28.809
"Not only am I unwilling to follow through

01:02:28.833 --> 01:02:31.476
on this set of commitments
or expectations,